---
description: Guidelines for creating and maintaining Cursor rules in this project
globs: .cursor/rules/*.mdc
alwaysApply: true
---

- **Required rule structure:**
  ```markdown
  ---
  description: Clear, one-line description
  globs: path/to/files/*.ext
  alwaysApply: false
  ---

  - **Main points in bold**
    - Actionable sub-points with examples
  ```

- **References:** Use `[filename](mdc:path/to/file)` for rule and code links.
- **Examples:** Include DO and DON'T snippets; prefer examples from this codebase once it exists.
- **Maintenance:** Update rules when new patterns appear in 3+ files; remove outdated guidance.
- **Quality:** One concern per rule file; keep each rule concise and actionable.
